<title>PHILIPPINES: Belle to issue warrant for every five shrs.</title>
<headline>Belle to issue warrant for every five shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming and property concern Belle Corp said on Monday its board of directors had approved the issuance of one warrant for every five common shares held.</p>
<p>The issuance of the bonus warrant, which would be for free, would entitle the holder to subscribe to one common share at the exercise price of 8.50 pesos per share, the company said.</p>
